  "statuteText": "659:15 Voter Proceeds to Booth. –\n\nOn receipt of his or her ballot, the voter shall forthwith without leaving the space enclosed by the guardrail proceed to one of the voting booths or voting privacy screens and shall mark his or her ballot."
